    "Name": "Osteon T",
    "Details": "The Osteon T retains the exceptional survivability of the Society's assault OmniMech, combining extensive Ferro-Lamellor armor with a protected Torso-Mounted Cockpit. Its weapons emphasize sustained close-to-medium-range combat, pairing twin Rotary AC/2s with four ER Medium Lasers, an LRM-10, and two SRM-6 launchers. This varied arsenal allows the Osteon to maintain effective fire across multiple engagement ranges while relying on its formidable protection to withstand prolonged combat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
